 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "MovieFriends(k) starts with no customers. watch(customerId, movieId) appends one movie to the customer's history. getFriends(customerId) returns, in ascending code-point order, every other customer whose current key equals this customer's key, where a key is the set of the last k watched entries (duplicates collapse) and exists only after at least k watches; it returns [] when the customer has no key. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
